# Agent Task: SMS / Push for HOT Listings

Add ntfyTopic: string to UserPreferences. In lib/email.ts add sendNtfyPush(listing, topic) that POSTs to https://ntfy.sh/{topic} with title, message, priority=urgent, tags=['house']. Call after sendHotAlert in scrape-pipeline.ts. Add ntfyTopic field to Settings page. Gracefully no-ops if topic is empty.

## Test requirements
Unit tests: mock fetch to ntfy.sh, verify payload shape, no-op when topic empty, priority=urgent on HOT tier only.
